OL,3,GNEWSAFootballers injured in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run, club says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA non-league football club has said
OL,7,Ffour of its players were injured by a
OL,8,Fhit-and-run driver in Leicester city
OL,9,Fcentre at the weekend.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said four
OL,12,Fpedestrians were struck by a vehicle in
OL,13,FVaughan Way on Saturday night, with two
OL,14,Fsuffering serious injuries.
OL,16,FA 38-year-old man was arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,18,Fdangerous driving, driving while over
OL,19,Fthe prescribed limit for alcohol and
OL,20,Fcausing grievous bodily harm. He has
OL,21,Fbeen released on bail "pending further
OL,22,Finquiries",
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
